  * fix: align columns in non-interactive mode (gh#dundee/gdu#500)
  * fix: support for sqlite db on all platforms (gh#dundee/gdu#507)
  * chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.45.0 to 1.46.1 
