- Version 5.33.0
  * feat: add SQLite analyzer and some assorted changes 
    (gh#dundee/gdu#484)
  * feat: add --archive-browsing flag to show zip/jar files as 
    dirs, add --collapse-path flag to for collapsing single-child 
